<view class="management-shell" style="{{chromeStyle}}"><view class="topbar"><button class="topbar__back {{navigating?'control--disabled':''}}" bindtap="back" disabled="{{navigating}}" aria-label="返回"><image class="topbar__back-icon" src="/assets/icons/arrow-left-ink.svg"/></button><text class="topbar__title">订单核对</text></view><view class="page page--stack management-order-detail"><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="state">正在读取最新订单与权限…</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="state state--error"><text>{{error}}</text><button wx:if="{{invalidId}}" class="text-button" bindtap="back">返回订单列表</button><button wx:else class="text-button" bindtap="load">重试</button></view><block wx:if="{{order}}"><text class="eyebrow">{{order.orderNumber}}</text><view class="page-title">{{order.statusLabel}}</view><text class="subtitle">创建于 {{order.createdLabel}}（北京时间） · 版本 {{order.version}}</text><view wx:if="{{canDispatch}}" class="admin-detail-card shipment-card"><strong>发货与微信同步</strong><text wx:if="{{shipmentLoading}}">正在核对履约状态…</text><text wx:if="{{shipmentError}}" aria-live="polite">{{shipmentError}}</text><block wx:if="{{shipment}}"><text>{{shipmentLabel}}</text><text wx:if="{{shipment.id}}">{{shipment.carrierName}} · {{shipment.trackingNumber}}</text><text wx:if="{{shipment.id}}">{{syncLabel}}</text><text wx:if="{{shipment.receiptConfirmedAt}}">买家已确认收货</text><block wx:if="{{shipment.wechatSyncState==='manual_review'}}"><text>微信同步需要人工核对；本地交寄事实已保留，请勿重新发货。</text><label><text>人工核对记录编号</text><input data-field="evidenceReference" bindinput="shipmentInput" value="{{form.evidenceReference}}" maxlength="120" disabled="{{dispatchBusy}}" aria-label="人工核对记录编号" placeholder="工单或运营核对记录编号"/></label><button class="primary-button {{dispatchBusy?'control--disabled':''}}" bindtap="reconcile" disabled="{{dispatchBusy}}" loading="{{dispatchBusy}}">重新查询微信结果</button></block><block wx:if="{{shipment.logisticsState==='awaiting_dispatch' && order.status==='paid' && order.transactionSourceKind==='verified_commerce'}}"><text>填写已实际交寄的整单包裹信息。</text><label><text>快递公司</text><input data-field="carrierName" bindinput="shipmentInput" value="{{form.carrierName}}" maxlength="80" disabled="{{dispatchBusy}}" aria-label="快递公司名称" placeholder="快递公司名称"/></label><label><text>微信快递公司编码</text><input data-field="carrierCode" bindinput="shipmentInput" value="{{form.carrierCode}}" maxlength="32" disabled="{{dispatchBusy}}" aria-label="微信快递公司编码" placeholder="例如 SF，请核对实际承运商"/></label><label><text>运单号</text><input data-field="trackingNumber" bindinput="shipmentInput" value="{{form.trackingNumber}}" maxlength="64" disabled="{{dispatchBusy}}" aria-label="真实运单号" placeholder="包裹实际运单号"/></label><view class="shipment-pickers"><picker mode="date" value="{{form.date}}" bindchange="shipmentDate" disabled="{{dispatchBusy}}" aria-label="实际交寄日期"><view class="shipment-picker-field">交寄日期（北京时间）：{{form.date || '请选择'}}</view></picker><label><text>交寄时间（北京时间，24 小时制）</text><input data-field="time" bindinput="shipmentInput" value="{{form.time}}" maxlength="5" disabled="{{dispatchBusy}}" aria-label="实际交寄时间，北京时间，时分" placeholder="例如 14:30"/></label></view><label><text>交寄凭证编号</text><input data-field="evidenceReference" bindinput="shipmentInput" value="{{form.evidenceReference}}" maxlength="120" disabled="{{dispatchBusy}}" aria-label="交寄凭证编号" placeholder="8–120 位字母、数字或 . _ : -"/></label><button class="primary-button {{dispatchBusy||shipmentLoading?'control--disabled':''}}" bindtap="submitShipment" disabled="{{dispatchBusy || shipmentLoading}}" loading="{{dispatchBusy}}">核对并登记发货</button></block></block><text wx:if="{{dispatchMessage}}" aria-live="polite">{{dispatchMessage}}</text><button class="text-button {{dispatchBusy?'text-button--disabled':''}}" bindtap="load" disabled="{{dispatchBusy}}">刷新核对原订单</button></view><view class="admin-detail-card"><strong>商品与金额</strong><view wx:for="{{order.lines}}" wx:key="id" class="admin-line"><text>{{item.productName}} · {{item.skuLabel}} × {{item.quantity}}</text><strong>¥{{item.totalYuan}}</strong></view><view class="admin-total"><text>商品与运费合计</text><strong>¥{{order.totalYuan}}</strong></view><view wx:if="{{order.creditTenderCents>0}}" class="admin-total"><text>购物权益 · 隔离测试</text><strong>− ¥{{order.creditYuan}}</strong></view><view wx:if="{{order.creditTenderCents>0}}" class="admin-total"><text>模拟渠道现金</text><strong>¥{{order.cashYuan}}</strong></view></view><view class="admin-detail-card"><strong>脱敏收货信息</strong><block wx:if="{{order.address}}"><text>{{order.address.recipientNameMasked}} · {{order.address.phoneMasked}}</text><text>{{order.addressSummary}}</text></block><text wx:else>地址快照暂时不可读</text></view><view class="privacy-note"><image src="/assets/icons/lock-key-plum.svg"/><text>收货信息按权限脱敏。付款、履约和售后各有独立事实；本页的订单状态不代表已完成签收或退款。</text></view></block></view></view>
